node_modules
**/dist
.git
*.md
server/data
# Runtime data — never bake the local DB or secrets into the image
data
**/cookies.txt
# Native Android project — the built APK ships via apk/, the project itself
# (gradle caches, build outputs) would only bloat the build context
client/android
# Only the current branded APK belongs in release images; ignored local staging
# can contain older generated builds.
apk/*-client.apk
!apk/play-client.apk
